  "scope": "The signed-occurrence filter excludes signed variable renaming between all 496 pairs of 32 candidate targets, including three same-shape pairs; equality is inconclusive and exclusion does not decide SAT or rule out semantic equivalence. The audit changes no scheduling and establishes no comparative speedup. Two independent retained sequences use the unchanged worker, each with two 32-state budgets. Both enter 64 states, store 54 patterns and leave nine final inputs unstored; one first-batch interruption is reentered and completed. A new 5/4/9 Horn, zero-valid terminal is reached, but the original-bound focus remains open and coverage stays 66/83. Both targets of the 25/96/309 next split remain pending. Cold replay reproduces every intermediate catalog without fresh discovery or reference search. All 4114 reference nodes are checked and all 3830 earlier payloads are unchanged. All 1361 artifacts across 27 previous manifests are preserved. The global positive certificate is byte-identical. Timed producer completed before regression tests and LaTeX. Regression tests and the first LaTeX build overlapped cold validation; the final manuscript-only rebuild followed cold completion. No holdout, peak-RAM saving, persistent-space reduction, minimal-expansion guarantee or unrestricted-SAT efficiency result is established.",
